        "图象."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "692",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "692. 在同一张图纸上，简略地作出函数 $y=(\\frac{1}{2})^x$ 和 $y=↵(\\frac{1}{3})^x$ 的图象. 大致画出函数 $y=0.4^x$ 的图象的位置."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "693",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "693. 分别在 $a>1$ 和 $0<a<1$ 的情况下，简略地作出函数 $y↵=a^x$ 和 $y=a$ 的图象. 比较这几个图象的相互位置."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "694",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "694. 比较下面各题里两式的值：",
        "а) $0.04^{-5}$ 和 $25^6$；　б) $(\\frac{2}{3})^{-6}$ 和 $1.5^8$；",
        "в) $0.5^{-11}$ 和 $2^{11}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "695",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "695. 设下列不等式成立，比较指数 $k$ 和 $m$ 的大小：",
        "а) $\\pi^k>\\pi^m$；　б) $(\\frac{\\pi}{3})^k<(\\frac{\\pi}{3})^m$；",
        "в) $(\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2})^k>(\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2})^m$；",
        "г) $(\\sqrt{7}-1)^k<(\\sqrt{7}-1)^m$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "696",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "696. 比较下列各式的值和 1 的大小：",
        "а) $(\\frac{3}{7})^x$；　б) $\\pi^x$；　в) $(\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{4})^{-\\frac{1}{3}}$；",
        "г) $(\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2})^{-\\frac{3}{2}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "697",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "697. 关于 $k$ 的符号可以作出什么结论？设：",
        "а) $5^k=10$；　б) $(0.3)^k=100$；　в) $7^k=1.003$；",
        "г) $0.4^k=18$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "698",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "698. 用图解法解下列方程：",
        "а) $2^x=x+1$；　б) $(0.3)^x=x+1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "699",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "699. 利用函数 $y=2^x$ 和 $y=x^2-2$ 的图象解方程"
      ]
    },
